<p>The Tuareg-dominated FLA separatist alliance said it seized Tessalit, a strategic military camp in northern Mali near the Algerian border, on Friday; a security source in Gao said regular troops had evacuated before rebel forces entered. The seizure followed large-scale weekend attacks by the FLA and the al-Qaeda-linked Group for the Support of Islam and Muslims, or JNIM, against key junta positions across Mali. JNIM began a road blockade around Bamako on April 30, allowing only people already in the capital to leave.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/gTClzQ1463iG-LnsIshyzHpcHZ44o_IHOdZnee7PmeyoLf7Wj3Jr0VG7M3wXXwa8oDtbD4trzI8Idluqcyss9dJdEsb5l9oqHr4n7RyOTUrrd-3T2gSTH0opwoMGtqO2_lMTW6we1IVBA0RVt55phPPlAkobgmVBg0bhiqZFVqMlFSs5ATfsMdnGsmALzV5DlF46O_TioVl9-s70qisp8orzGs5JInPotO-pilk0nV0KklYvRqNUr4YCb7U5Cg' alt='Security-related image from Mali during reporting on the Tessalit military camp seizure.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Aguelhok expansion: Le Matin d’Algérie reported that Russian paramilitaries also left Aguelhok on May 1, putting another northern position under FLA control.</li><li>Kidal reaction: The Financial Times said rebels celebrated the retreat of Russian paramilitaries from Kidal in northern Mali as the offensive gathered pace.</li></ul><blockquote>No clashes took place - Security source in Gao</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>FLA separatist group: An FLA official said government forces were scattering south after FLA forces took Tessalit. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1996814/rebels-take-key-military-camp-in-malis-north'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>JNIM: JNIM fighters called for cooperation with other armed groups to bring down Mali’s junta. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1996814/rebels-take-key-military-camp-in-malis-north'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Local elected official: A local representative told AFP that the Malian army and its Russian allies left their positions in Tessalit on Friday morning. (<a href='https://vrtnws.be/p.8e6KRPZ9G'>VRT NWS</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/rebels-take-key-military-camp-in-malis-north/article70929644.ece'>Rebels take key military camp in Mali&#x27;s north</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/5/1/rebel-checkpoints-reported-mali-capital-town-seized'>Rebel checkpoints reported around Mali’s capital, northern town seized</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1996814/rebels-take-key-military-camp-in-malis-north'>Rebels take key military camp in Mali’s north</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.barrons.com/news/rebels-take-key-military-camp-in-mali-s-north-f5fdc5a1'>Jama&#x27;at Nusrat al-Islam wal-Muslimin takes over a base outside of Tessalit, Kidal Region, Mali, after it is abandoned by Malian troops and Russia&#x27;s Africa Corps.</a> - barrons.com</li><li><a href='http://www.africanews.com/2026/05/01/rebel-alliance-seizes-key-tessalit-military-camp-in-northern-mali/'>Rebel alliance seizes key Tessalit military camp in northern Mali</a> - africanews.com</li><li><a href='https://vrtnws.be/p.8e6KRPZ9G'>Strategisch militair kamp Tessalit in Mali in handen van Toeareg-rebellen</a> - vrtnws.be</li><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/fb218ffa-7c70-48e6-9db3-7d13f600a974'>Jihadis blockade Malian capital as offensive gathers pace</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nrk.no/nyheter/opprorere-har-inntatt-militaerbase-i-mali-1.17868686'>Opprørere har inntatt militærbase i Mali</a> - nrk.no</li><li><a href='https://www.aftonbladet.se/nyheter/a/gk3nKJ/efter-juntan-lamnat-rebeller-uppges-avancera'>Efter juntan lämnat – rebeller uppges avancera</a> - aftonbladet.se</li><li><a href='https://lematindalgerie.com/mali-le-camp-de-tessalit-sous-le-controle-des-touareg-du-fla/'>Mali : le camp de Tessalit sous le contrôle des Touareg du FLA</a> - lematindalgerie.com</li><li><a href='https://www.skynewsarabia.com/world/1867286-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B7%D9%8